<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 59 0 R
/T (The small, heterogeneous sample of 13 professionals limits transferability and cannot represent women leaders in India or internationally. Interview notes varied in detail and were not audio-recorded or uniformly transcribed, limiting the reliability of quoted wording and the ability to revisit context. The sampling strategy, and geographic coverage, participant demographics, and interview procedures require fuller reporting. Recall and social-desirability effects uneven)
/E (The small, heterogeneous sample of 13 professionals limits transferability and cannot represent women leaders in India or internationally. Interview notes varied in detail and were not audio-recorded or uniformly transcribed, limiting the reliability of quoted wording and the ability to revisit context. The sampling strategy, and geographic coverage, participant demographics, and interview procedures require fuller reporting. Recall and social-desirability effects uneven)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
