293 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 59 0 R
/T (Future research could use a transparent sampling strategy and, with appropriate consent, audio recordings or validated interview transcripts across industries, geographic contexts,  career stages. Quantitative measures could be introduced to assess constructs identified in this exploratory study. Comparative organisational studies could examine mento-   -ring, sponsorship, psychological safety, fair recognition. Mixed-methods research could further examine about the proposed framework using validated measures alongside qualitative accounts, and while retaining the attention to experiences that do not fit a single narrative.)
/E (Future research could use a transparent sampling strategy and, with appropriate consent, audio recordings or validated interview transcripts across industries, geographic contexts,  career stages. Quantitative measures could be introduced to assess constructs identified in this exploratory study. Comparative organisational studies could examine mento-   -ring, sponsorship, psychological safety, fair recognition. Mixed-methods research could further examine about the proposed framework using validated measures alongside qualitative accounts, and while retaining the attention to experiences that do not fit a single narrative.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
